<title>USA: KCBT wheat falls sharply, locals spread CBOT/KCBT.</title>
<headline>KCBT wheat falls sharply, locals spread CBOT/KCBT.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat futures on the KCBT fell sharply early as local traders bought CBOT wheat and sold KCBT wheat, floor sources said.</p>
<p>Weakness in both Kansas City and Chicago was also tied to ideas that the markets were severely overbought after recent gains, traders said.</p>
</text>
